        "original_id": "44c51d28-a111-57fe-87bc-e0c187268145",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ronnie Simpson\n- Organizations: Celtic F.C.\n- Places: Glasgow, Scotland\n- Events: European Cup 1967\n- Topics: Lisbon Lions, Scottish Premiership\n\nFacts:\n- Celtic F.C. was founded in 1887 to alleviate poverty in the immigrant Irish population in Glasgow's East End.\n- Celtic F.C. is a professional football club based in Glasgow, Scotland, and it plays in the Scottish Premiership.\n- In 1967, Ronnie Simpson was part of Celtic F.C.'s \"Lisbon Lions\" team that won the European Cup.\n- Ronnie Simpson is mainly remembered for his time with Celtic F.C.",
